# Forgekit

Forgekit is a professional CLI for generating clean, production-ready GitHub repositories in seconds.

## Why Forgekit?

Starting a project should not mean manually recreating the same repository structure every time.

Forgekit automates the boring parts while keeping the generated project simple, readable and customizable.

## Features

- Multi-language project scaffolding
- GitHub Actions CI
- Issue templates
- Pull request template
- Security policy
- Contribution guidelines
- Changelog
- License configuration
- Dry-run validation
- Zero database
- Minimal runtime dependencies

